& [P3TSFR-007] requires current Equal reconciliation
& [P3TSFR-008] requires form, derivation, issuance, consumption, and truth separation
& [P3TSFR-009] requires unchanged formation and zero authority delta
& [P3TSFR-010] requires full SJS, artifact binding, rollback, and nonclaims

& [ImplementationAndEffectBoundary] is empty
  + changed production modules zero
  + Cargo and dependency delta zero
  + public runtime type and API delta zero
  + unsafe, platform, filesystem, handle, pointer, clock, process, network, persistence, database, Git runtime, model, tool, fixture, scan, acquisition, issuance, consumption, admission, mutation, seal, test execution, cleanup, promotion, neural, distributed, and FPGA authority absent

& [Verification] is formation scoped
  + exact hash and role binding for all source and derived artifacts
  + all ten requirements and twenty-four constraints mapped and reapplied
  + seven folds and data design passed
  + prior formation remains byte immutable
  + repository production and Cargo deltas remain zero
  + current recursive evidence remains valid
  + replacement signature binds complete artifacts and grants formation authority only

& [Rollback] is source safe
  + invalidate this replacement formation generation
  + preserve raw source, prior formation, completed current forms, lower carrier authorities, and Git history
  + no code, persisted state, receipt, fixture, consumer, or external system requires reversal

& [StopBoundary] is absolute
  - never: treat this canonical as M2C implementation or M2D execution authority
  - never: infer actual acquisition from supplied data, forms, or Equal
  - never: infer causal order from operand position
  - never: infer issuance from valid receipt or consumption from issuance
  - never: infer quiescence, snapshot, stability, immutability, safety, or present truth
  - never: add code, dependency, runtime representation, API, clock, platform, physical, issuer, consumer, or effect surface under this signature

